hadiths[13]{hadithnumber,text}:
"106","Musa ibn Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hammad ne kaha: Main ne Qays ibn Sad se kaha: Mere liye Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm ka khat hasil karo, to unhon ne mujhe ek khat diya, khabar dete hue ke unhon ne use Abu Bakr ibn Muhammad ibn Amr ibn Hazm se liya tha, ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne use un ke dada ko likha tha. Main ne use parha, aur us mein oonton par aaid faraiz mein se jo wajib hai us ka zikr tha. Unhon ne hadith bayan ki yahan tak ke ek sau bees tak pahunche; agar us se zyada hon to har pachaas par ek hiqqah shumar karo, aur jo bache wo oonton ke pehle farize ki taraf lautaya jayega. Aur jo pachees se kam ho to us mein bakriyan wajib hain: har paanch oonton par ek bakri, jin mein na nar ho, na buddhi ho aur na aibdar bakri ho."
"107","Qutaybah ibn Said ne hum se bayan kiya, aur Ahmad ibn Abdah ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne humein khabar di, Ibrahim ibn Maysarah se, Tawus se, ke Hazrat Muadh ibn Jabal ke paas Yaman se zakat ke nisab se kam umr gaay-bail aur bakriyan layi gayin, to unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne mujhe in dono ke bare mein kuch hukm nahin diya."
"108","Abdullah ibn Maslamah ne hum se bayan kiya, Malik se, Humayd ibn Qays se, Tawus al-Yamani se, ke Hazrat Muadh ibn Jabal ne tees gaayon mein se ek tabi liya aur chalis gaayon mein se ek musinnah liya. Un ke paas us se kam laya gaya to unhon ne us mein se lene se inkar kar diya aur kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) se is bare mein kuch nahin suna yahan tak ke main un se milun aur un se puchhun. Phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) Hazrat Muadh ibn Jabal ke pahunchne se pehle wafat pa gaye."
"109","Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Thawr ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mamar ne kaha: Simak ibn al-Fadl ne mujhe Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ka Malik ibn Kaflanis aur al-Muqawqis ke naam ek khat diya, jis mein tha: Gaay-bail mein wahi hai jo oonton mein hai."
"110","Usi sanad se Mamar se, al-Zuhri se, unhon ne kaha, Hazrat Jabir ibn Abdullah se: Har paanch gaayon par aur das par do bakriyan hain; pandrah par teen bakriyan; aur bees par chaar bakriyan. Al-Zuhri ne kaha: Jab pachees hon to pichhattar tak ek gaay wajib hai, jis mein ek sau bees tak do gaayen wajib hain; agar ek sau bees se zyada ho jayen to har chalis gaayon par ek gaay hai. Mamar ne kaha: Al-Zuhri ne kaha: Humein ye baat pahunchi hai ke un ka ye kehna - Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Har tees gaayon par ek tabi hai, aur har chalis gaayon par ek gaay hai - Yaman walon ke liye ek riayat thi, phir is ke baad ye aaya."
"111","Muhammad ibn Ubayd ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Thawr ne hum se bayan kiya, Mamar se, Ayyub se, unhon ne kaha: Ek zamane tak main unhein kehte hue sunta raha: Hum se wo lo jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne liya, aur main hairan hota tha ke wo un se kyun qabool nahin kiya jata tha, yahan tak ke al-Zuhri ne mujhe bataya ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne ye faraiz likhe lekin apne amilon ko likhne se pehle wafat pa gaye. Abu Bakr ne jo unhon ne likha tha us par amal kiya, jahan tak mujhe ilm hai gaay-bail ka bhi zikr kiya."
"112","Muhammad ibn Mansur al-Tusi ne hum se bayan kiya, Yaqub ne hum se bayan kiya, mere walid ne hum se bayan kiya, Ibn Ishaq se, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad ibn Muslim al-Zuhri ne zikr kiya ke Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne sadqe ke bare mein jo ahkam pukhta farmaye un mein se ye tha ke unhon ne Hazrat Muadh ibn Jabal ke sath pehle khat ke baad gaay-bail ke awqas ke liye muqarrar farmaya - aur awqas paanch gaayon se lekar das tak hain - ke das mein do bakriyan hain; phir unhon ne gaay-bail ke sadqe ko oonton ke sadqe ki tarah kar diya."
"113","Hamein Musa ibn Ismail ne bayan kiya, hamein Hammad ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Hisham ibn Urwah se, unhon ne Urwah se riwayat kiya ke Hazrat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne sadqa wasool karne ke liye ek shakhs ko bheja aur use hukm diya ke woh jawan oontni, buddhi oontni aur ayb wali oontni le le, lekin un ke maal ki behtareen aur pasandeedah cheezon se bache."
"114","Hamein al-Hasan ibn Ali ne bayan kiya, hamein Affan ne bayan kiya, hamein Abdul Waris ne bayan kiya, hamein Abu Salamah al-Khurasani ne bayan kiya - al-Hasan ne kaha: woh Ghalib ibn Sulaiman hain - hamein Kathir Abu Sahl ne bayan kiya, jabke hum Khurasan me the, unhon ne al-Hasan se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Allah ne tumhare liye teen cheezon se darguzar farmaya hai: peshani, nukhkhah aur kusa se. Kathir ne kaha: Log samajhte the ke peshani se murad ghode hain, nukhkhah se murad kaam karne wale aur pani lane wale oont hain, aur kusa se murad chhoti bakriyan hain."
"115","Hamein al-Hasan ibn Ali ne bayan kiya, hamein Sulaiman ibn Harb ne bayan kiya, hamein Ghalib ibn Sulaiman ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Kathir ibn Ziyad se, unhon ne al-Hasan se isi hadith ke sath riwayat kiya, aur unhon ne kaha: Nukhkhah se murad chhoti bakriyan hain aur kusa se murad gadhe hain."
"116","Hamein Kathir ibn Ubaid al-Madhhiji ne bayan kiya, hamein al-Walid ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Muhammad ibn Rashid se, unhon ne Makhul se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Sadqat ko us waqt tak wapas na kharido jab tak unhein bandh na liya jaye aur un par nishan na lagaya jaye. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Ye Makhul ke qaul ke taur par bhi riwayat kiya gaya hai."
"117","Hamein Muhammad ibn Qudamah ibn Ayan ne bayan kiya, hamein Jarir ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Mansur se, unhon ne al-Hakam se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne Muadh ibn Jabal ko jab woh Yemen me the likha: Har baligh mard aur aurat par ek dinar ya us ke barabar qeemat ke Maafiri kapde hain, aur kisi Yahudi ko us ki Yahudiyat se na phera jaye."
"118","Hamein Abdullah ibn al-Jarrah ne bayan kiya, unhon ne Wahb se, unhon ne Jarir ibn Hazim se, unhon ne Qais ibn Sad se, unhon ne Makhul se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Phalon ke andaze me logon par narmi karo, kyunke maal me ariyyah hote hain; ek aur rawi ne kaha: aur watiyyah. Hamein Mahmud ibn Khalid ne bayan kiya, hamein Umar ne bayan kiya: Maine al-Awzai se pucha, unhon ne kaha: Watiyyah woh hai jo logon me chalta phirta hai. Abu Dawud ne kaha: Sahih lafz al-watiyyah hai, yani woh jo zameen par ata jata hai aur us me se khata hai."
